!
! This test calculates the B3LYP energy of various closed shell molecules
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
 Generic input for NR B3LYP energy
.WAVE FUNCTION
**HAMILTONIAN
.LEVY-LEBLOND
.DFT
 B3LYP
**WAVE FUNCTION
.DHF
*END OF


